PROVENANCE

These icons are original artwork commissioned for unifi-topology. They are not
derived from, and share no geometry with, the isopacks set bundled under
assets/icons/isometric/ (MIT, Copyright 2023 Mark Mankarious): the two sets have
no path or polygon data in common, use different outline colours and palettes,
and were produced with different tooling.

Some filenames deliberately mirror the isopacks inventory so the two sets are
interchangeable at the same call sites. Filenames and subject matter are not
themselves subject to copyright.


TRADEMARKS

These icons depict generic network hardware in a style evocative of UniFi
equipment. "UniFi" and "Ubiquiti" are trademarks of Ubiquiti Inc. This project
is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Ubiquiti Inc., and the set
contains no Ubiquiti logo, wordmark, or other brand asset.
